      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\"><img src=\"assets/logo.png\" width=\"160\" alt=\"dsh-vision logo\"></p>\n<h1 align=\"center\">dsh-vision</h1>\n\n[DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness): vision!\n\nNative, minimal plugin that adds vision capability.\n\n极简的原生视觉增强插件。"
