    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "```shell\nnpm i -g @deepseek-ai/dsh\ndsh plugin --profile web add \"github:xiaoshihou514/dsh-weixin#main\"\n```\n\nSupports Zhipu (free) and Qwen-VL 2B (local).\n\n支持调用免费的智谱接口或使用本地的千问视觉小模型。\n\n[MIT](LICENSE)\n\nAlso check out my other plugins ;)\n\n也看看我其他的插件吧～\n\n- [dsh-desktop-pet](https://github.com/xiaoshihou514/dsh-desktop-pet)\n- [dsh-weixin](https://github.com/xiaoshihou514/dsh-weixin)\n- [dsh-tui](https://github.com/xiaoshihou514/dsh-tui)"
